{"font_size": 0.4, "font_color": "#FFFFFF", "background_alpha": 0.5, "background_color": "#9C27B0", "Stroke": "none", "type": "AIsubtitle", "lang": "zh", "version": "v1.7.0.4", "body": [{"from": 0.1, "to": 3.36, "sid": 1, "location": 2, "content": "为什么我不推荐你先瞄准再开枪", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 3.36, "to": 6.94, "sid": 2, "location": 2, "content": "这个视频我将打破你对冷静瞄准的认知", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 6.94, "to": 8.39, "sid": 3, "location": 2, "content": "你先别急着反驳我", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 11.76, "to": 16.2, "sid": 4, "location": 2, "content": "大部分人所理解的先瞄准再开枪和冷静瞄准", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 16.2, "to": 18.48, "sid": 5, "location": 2, "content": "是指把准星放人头上", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 18.48, "to": 20.03, "sid": 6, "location": 2, "content": "然后再开枪", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 20.23, "to": 21.35, "sid": 7, "location": 2, "content": "但是你发现了吗", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 21.35, "to": 24.37, "sid": 8, "location": 2, "content": "这里如果专注于去瞄准人物头部再开枪", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 24.37, "to": 25.55, "sid": 9, "location": 2, "content": "在大多数时候", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 25.55, "to": 27.91, "sid": 10, "location": 2, "content": "敌人根本就不会给你开枪的机会", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 27.91, "to": 29.69, "sid": 11, "location": 2, "content": "在自己已经瞄好的时候", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 29.69, "to": 31.64, "sid": 12, "location": 2, "content": "就已经被敌方击杀", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 31.64, "to": 33.08, "sid": 13, "location": 2, "content": "或者开枪时", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 33.08, "to": 35.38, "sid": 14, "location": 2, "content": "敌方已经离开自己的视野范围", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 35.38, "to": 37.32, "sid": 15, "location": 2, "content": "错失了开枪的机会", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 37.32, "to": 39.02, "sid": 16, "location": 2, "content": "在这里我要告诉你的是", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 39.02, "to": 40.54, "sid": 17, "location": 2, "content": "在神话二以上", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 40.54, "to": 45.39, "sid": 18, "location": 2, "content": "顶分或者职业选手都是边开枪边瞄准微调的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 45.39, "to": 47.89, "sid": 19, "location": 2, "content": "那么这时候就有长得帅的朋友要问了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 47.89, "to": 48.83, "sid": 20, "location": 2, "content": "电坤小子", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 48.83, "to": 51.58, "sid": 21, "location": 2, "content": "你是不是又要拿PREME或者wot来举例", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 51.58, "to": 54.14, "sid": 22, "location": 2, "content": "那人家的反应速度和我们能比吗", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 54.14, "to": 56.72, "sid": 23, "location": 2, "content": "或者是说人家都已经职业选手了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 56.72, "to": 57.84, "sid": 24, "location": 2, "content": "那有可比性吗", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 57.84, "to": 59.39, "sid": 25, "location": 2, "content": "你先别急着反驳", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 59.39, "to": 61.95, "sid": 26, "location": 2, "content": "不知道大家有没有练过六目标的同学", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 61.95, "to": 64.43, "sid": 27, "location": 2, "content": "你们你们是不是有这样的情况", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 64.43, "to": 65.57, "sid": 28, "location": 2, "content": "很多同学跟我讲哦", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 65.57, "to": 67.03, "sid": 29, "location": 2, "content": "我六目标12万分", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 67.03, "to": 69.32, "sid": 30, "location": 2, "content": "13万分还是个铂金钻石", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 69.32, "to": 70.62, "sid": 31, "location": 2, "content": "天天练目标", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 70.62, "to": 73.68, "sid": 32, "location": 2, "content": "反而感觉自己的瞄准水平越来越差了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 73.68, "to": 77.15, "sid": 33, "location": 2, "content": "战绩甚至没有之前没有练过的好瞄准", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 77.15, "to": 79.83, "sid": 34, "location": 2, "content": "没有了之前那样轻松写意的感觉", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 79.83, "to": 83.13, "sid": 35, "location": 2, "content": "瞄准变成了一件很累很费神的事情", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 83.13, "to": 85.93, "sid": 36, "location": 2, "content": "一旦空了第一枪瞬间就会慌神", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 85.93, "to": 88.39, "sid": 37, "location": 2, "content": "见到人甚至反而开不出枪来了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 88.39, "to": 89.85, "sid": 38, "location": 2, "content": "或者是天天打侧面靶", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 89.85, "to": 92.01, "sid": 39, "location": 2, "content": "明明已经可以侧面靶80多秒", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 92.01, "to": 94.09, "sid": 40, "location": 2, "content": "实战却还是开不出枪来", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 94.09, "to": 98.21, "sid": 41, "location": 2, "content": "那么问题一就在于这两者之间的环境不同", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 98.21, "to": 101.5, "sid": 42, "location": 2, "content": "首先是练枪的环境是属于乌鸦环境", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 101.5, "to": 103.3, "sid": 43, "location": 2, "content": "你没有任何道具信息", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 103.3, "to": 104.34, "sid": 44, "location": 2, "content": "枪械的干扰", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 104.34, "to": 108.46, "sid": 45, "location": 2, "content": "且你拥有足够的时间去完成描这个过程", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 108.46, "to": 111.58, "sid": 46, "location": 2, "content": "但是在排位中是处于高压环境", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 111.58, "to": 112.9, "sid": 47, "location": 2, "content": "随着分段的增加", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 112.9, "to": 115.4, "sid": 48, "location": 2, "content": "如果在你预瞄不够精进的情况下", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 115.4, "to": 118.62, "sid": 49, "location": 2, "content": "你是没有足够的时间去做缓慢瞄", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 118.62, "to": 122.63, "sid": 50, "location": 2, "content": "这个过程的在你执着于确认感瞄这一过程中", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 122.63, "to": 124.77, "sid": 51, "location": 2, "content": "敌人蹲扫就给你打死了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 124.77, "to": 127.52, "sid": 52, "location": 2, "content": "那么这时候你肯定会极度不平衡", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 127.52, "to": 129.16, "sid": 53, "location": 2, "content": "凭什么我天天练枪", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 129.16, "to": 130.3, "sid": 54, "location": 2, "content": "增加我的爆头率", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 130.3, "to": 133.42, "sid": 55, "location": 2, "content": "要注重点头击杀就打不过这些不练枪", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 133.42, "to": 134.98, "sid": 56, "location": 2, "content": "爆头率20多的人呢", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 134.98, "to": 136.64, "sid": 57, "location": 2, "content": "他们只会扫射压枪", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 136.64, "to": 138.62, "sid": 58, "location": 2, "content": "为什么我还是打不过呢", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 138.62, "to": 140.74, "sid": 59, "location": 2, "content": "会陷入深深的自我怀疑", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 140.74, "to": 143.32, "sid": 60, "location": 2, "content": "自己天天如此练枪真的有用吗", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 143.32, "to": 144.38, "sid": 61, "location": 2, "content": "原因就在于", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 144.38, "to": 148.01, "sid": 62, "location": 2, "content": "实战中的输出窗口是有限的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 148.01, "to": 151.47, "sid": 63, "location": 2, "content": "你把你的输出窗口全放在了描这个过程", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 151.47, "to": 152.579, "sid": 64, "location": 2, "content": "追求准度", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 152.579, "to": 156.359, "sid": 65, "location": 2, "content": "而敌人把输出窗口放在了开枪射击这个过程", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 156.359, "to": 157.82, "sid": 66, "location": 2, "content": "追求击杀效率", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 157.82, "to": 158.58, "sid": 67, "location": 2, "content": "问题是", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 158.58, "to": 161.52, "sid": 68, "location": 2, "content": "实战中的输出窗口并没有你想象中的那么多", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 161.52, "to": 165.16, "sid": 69, "location": 2, "content": "且有各种因素减少你的输出窗口", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 165.16, "to": 167.24, "sid": 70, "location": 2, "content": "道具会压缩你的走位空间", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 167.24, "to": 168.68, "sid": 71, "location": 2, "content": "减少你的输出窗口", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 168.68, "to": 170.2, "sid": 72, "location": 2, "content": "敌方开枪打中你", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 170.2, "to": 171.2, "sid": 73, "location": 2, "content": "射击减速", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 171.2, "to": 172.92, "sid": 74, "location": 2, "content": "限制你的走位能力", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 172.92, "to": 174.52, "sid": 75, "location": 2, "content": "增加你的瞄准难度", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 174.52, "to": 176.16, "sid": 76, "location": 2, "content": "也就增加你的数据窗口", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 176.16, "to": 179.1, "sid": 77, "location": 2, "content": "敌人的移动也会增加你的瞄准时间", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 179.1, "to": 181.01, "sid": 78, "location": 2, "content": "占用你的数据窗口", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 181.01, "to": 184.39, "sid": 79, "location": 2, "content": "我们的输出窗口需要做的事情有阅读目标", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 184.39, "to": 185.37, "sid": 80, "location": 2, "content": "做出反应", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 185.37, "to": 186.55, "sid": 81, "location": 2, "content": "拉枪开枪", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 186.55, "to": 188.85, "sid": 82, "location": 2, "content": "而略目标和侧面把式", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 188.85, "to": 192.07, "sid": 83, "location": 2, "content": "不会培养你快速阅读目标的能力的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 192.07, "to": 193.99, "sid": 84, "location": 2, "content": "还会刻意增加你的描", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 193.99, "to": 197.05, "sid": 85, "location": 2, "content": "这一过程让你过度注重确认感", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 197.05, "to": 200.019, "sid": 86, "location": 2, "content": "使你开枪窗口时间变得非常少", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 200.019, "to": 202.599, "sid": 87, "location": 2, "content": "甚至会让你养成看准星瞄准", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 202.599, "to": 203.979, "sid": 88, "location": 2, "content": "看准心去拉枪", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 203.979, "to": 207.829, "sid": 89, "location": 2, "content": "用准心确认与目标是否重合的坏习惯", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 207.829, "to": 211.709, "sid": 90, "location": 2, "content": "我之前在铂金分段就因为过度看准星这个问题", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 211.709, "to": 212.949, "sid": 91, "location": 2, "content": "卡了一个月之久", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 212.949, "to": 216.07, "sid": 92, "location": 2, "content": "那么问题二就在于敌方单位的不同", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 216.07, "to": 218.73, "sid": 93, "location": 2, "content": "为什么我从来不让我的粉丝或者学员", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 218.73, "to": 220.76, "sid": 94, "location": 2, "content": "练习静止靶和流目标呢", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 220.76, "to": 221.72, "sid": 95, "location": 2, "content": "因为实战中", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 221.72, "to": 224.36, "sid": 96, "location": 2, "content": "我们大部分时候面对的是一个未知的敌人", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 224.36, "to": 226.399, "sid": 97, "location": 2, "content": "且是一个移动的敌人", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 226.399, "to": 229.599, "sid": 98, "location": 2, "content": "你需要做出对敌方行动轨迹的判断", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 229.599, "to": 230.639, "sid": 99, "location": 2, "content": "并且开枪", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 230.639, "to": 232.77, "sid": 100, "location": 2, "content": "如果你专注于瞄这个过程", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 232.77, "to": 235.63, "sid": 101, "location": 2, "content": "在你的瞄准并没有达到经济之前", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 235.63, "to": 237.33, "sid": 102, "location": 2, "content": "大概率面对移动的敌人", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 237.33, "to": 239.95, "sid": 103, "location": 2, "content": "每次开枪都是敌人移动前的位置", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 239.95, "to": 241.27, "sid": 104, "location": 2, "content": "导致一枪不中", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 241.27, "to": 245.11, "sid": 105, "location": 2, "content": "而静止法并不能训练我们阅读目标的能力", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 245.11, "to": 248.67, "sid": 106, "location": 2, "content": "更没有训练我们持续阅读目标的能力", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 248.67, "to": 251.53, "sid": 107, "location": 2, "content": "进行一个预判走位的能力", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 251.53, "to": 252.47, "sid": 108, "location": 2, "content": "实战中", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 252.47, "to": 256.409, "sid": 109, "location": 2, "content": "这样的瞄准场景会随着段位的提升越来越少", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 256.409, "to": 259.689, "sid": 110, "location": 2, "content": "这也就是为什么刚开始你觉得哦练六目标靶场", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 259.689, "to": 261.209, "sid": 111, "location": 2, "content": "侧面靶可能真的有用", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 261.209, "to": 262.149, "sid": 112, "location": 2, "content": "但是慢慢的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 262.149, "to": 264.449, "sid": 113, "location": 2, "content": "无论你一天怎么样练靶场怎么样打", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 264.449, "to": 267.69, "sid": 114, "location": 2, "content": "练枪软件段位几乎得不到任何的提升", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 267.69, "to": 270.51, "sid": 115, "location": 2, "content": "因为无畏契约是一个3D的游戏", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 270.51, "to": 272.14, "sid": 116, "location": 2, "content": "并不是平面游戏", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 272.14, "to": 274.7, "sid": 117, "location": 2, "content": "敌方移动的同时你也会移动", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 274.7, "to": 277.51, "sid": 118, "location": 2, "content": "并且敌方是突然出现的目标", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 277.51, "to": 280.57, "sid": 119, "location": 2, "content": "并不是五个人排的整整齐齐的在你脸上给你打", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 280.57, "to": 283.53, "sid": 120, "location": 2, "content": "实战中更多的是需要你去阅读", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 283.53, "to": 285.69, "sid": 121, "location": 2, "content": "去预判敌方的行动轨迹", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 285.69, "to": 287.25, "sid": 122, "location": 2, "content": "而静止靶和内目标", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 287.25, "to": 290.27, "sid": 123, "location": 2, "content": "会刻意增加你的阅读反应时间", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 290.27, "to": 293.91, "sid": 124, "location": 2, "content": "那你会觉得不完全重合就开枪是不对的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 293.91, "to": 297.05, "sid": 125, "location": 2, "content": "导致一种我的反应为什么越来越慢的假象", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 297.05, "to": 299.299, "sid": 126, "location": 2, "content": "最终越瞄越打不中", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 299.299, "to": 300.099, "sid": 127, "location": 2, "content": "越打不中", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 300.099, "to": 302.139, "sid": 128, "location": 2, "content": "就越刻意的去描的一种恶循环", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 304.099, "to": 307.229, "sid": 129, "location": 2, "content": "问题三就在于我们射击模式的不同", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 307.229, "to": 310.489, "sid": 130, "location": 2, "content": "在练枪软件中是只能够一发一发瞄准的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 310.489, "to": 314.429, "sid": 131, "location": 2, "content": "所以说需要极其精准的先微调再开枪", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 314.429, "to": 316.409, "sid": 132, "location": 2, "content": "但是在无畏契约的游戏中", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 316.409, "to": 318.589, "sid": 133, "location": 2, "content": "大部分枪械都是全自动的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 318.589, "to": 320.72, "sid": 134, "location": 2, "content": "且是有方法可控的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 320.72, "to": 323.52, "sid": 135, "location": 2, "content": "并不需要我们第一发就精准命中头部", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 323.52, "to": 325.48, "sid": 136, "location": 2, "content": "在大部分FPS游戏中", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 325.48, "to": 327.89, "sid": 137, "location": 2, "content": "因为武器有后坐力的存在", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 327.89, "to": 332.73, "sid": 138, "location": 2, "content": "控枪的能力往往比主动瞄准的能力更加重要", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 332.73, "to": 335.35, "sid": 139, "location": 2, "content": "因为我们并不能保证每一次的开火", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 335.35, "to": 337.039, "sid": 140, "location": 2, "content": "都能够直接命中头部", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 337.039, "to": 338.919, "sid": 141, "location": 2, "content": "大部分时候我们开一枪后", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 338.919, "to": 341.59, "sid": 142, "location": 2, "content": "子弹与敌人的距离往往非常小", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 341.59, "to": 344.31, "sid": 143, "location": 2, "content": "我们并不需要先微调再开枪", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 344.31, "to": 346.78, "sid": 144, "location": 2, "content": "而是边开枪边微调", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 346.78, "to": 348.46, "sid": 145, "location": 2, "content": "持续微调阅读目标", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 348.46, "to": 350.16, "sid": 146, "location": 2, "content": "全自动武器的优势就在于", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 350.16, "to": 353.62, "sid": 147, "location": 2, "content": "我们能够在开枪的过程中就完成微调", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 353.62, "to": 355.1, "sid": 148, "location": 2, "content": "并不需要先瞄准", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 355.1, "to": 356.54, "sid": 149, "location": 2, "content": "微调后再开枪", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 356.54, "to": 357.82, "sid": 150, "location": 2, "content": "第一枪没中后", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 357.82, "to": 361.14, "sid": 151, "location": 2, "content": "可以选择控枪击杀或者碎步移动一下", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 361.14, "to": 363.08, "sid": 152, "location": 2, "content": "快速的微调开枪即可", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 363.08, "to": 364.34, "sid": 153, "location": 2, "content": "如果打中身体", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 364.34, "to": 365.94, "sid": 154, "location": 2, "content": "敌方受击减速后", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 365.94, "to": 368.06, "sid": 155, "location": 2, "content": "我们可以选择直接压枪击杀", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 368.06, "to": 370.36, "sid": 156, "location": 2, "content": "亦可以选择马上碎步调整", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 370.36, "to": 371.9, "sid": 157, "location": 2, "content": "打一个受击减速", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 371.9, "to": 373.68, "sid": 158, "location": 2, "content": "接近于静止法的目标", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 373.68, "to": 374.62, "sid": 159, "location": 2, "content": "进行爆头", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 374.62, "to": 377.92, "sid": 160, "location": 2, "content": "简单击杀第一发子弹的精准度固然重要", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 377.92, "to": 380.38, "sid": 161, "location": 2, "content": "但是我们不是靶场打靶", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 380.38, "to": 381.88, "sid": 162, "location": 2, "content": "也不是练枪软件", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 381.88, "to": 384.9, "sid": 163, "location": 2, "content": "点小球不是只能够一发一发的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 384.9, "to": 388.05, "sid": 164, "location": 2, "content": "开枪的击杀效率永远都是最优先级", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 388.05, "to": 391.17, "sid": 165, "location": 2, "content": "千万不要为了爆头率和第一发子弹的精准度", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 391.17, "to": 393.18, "sid": 166, "location": 2, "content": "而丢失击杀效率", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 393.18, "to": 395.14, "sid": 167, "location": 2, "content": "我复盘了上百个学员", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 395.14, "to": 396.16, "sid": 168, "location": 2, "content": "见到无数次", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 396.16, "to": 399.379, "sid": 169, "location": 2, "content": "明明敌人就在脸上或者一个背身直接压枪", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 399.379, "to": 402.219, "sid": 170, "location": 2, "content": "就能拿到击杀去选择慢慢去瞄", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 402.219, "to": 404.799, "sid": 171, "location": 2, "content": "而错失击杀机会或者被反杀", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 404.799, "to": 406.239, "sid": 172, "location": 2, "content": "问题四就在于", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 406.239, "to": 410.13, "sid": 173, "location": 2, "content": "很多人觉得瞄准和微调是割裂开来的两个步骤", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 410.13, "to": 412.85, "sid": 174, "location": 2, "content": "但实际上瞄准和微调是一个协调", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 412.85, "to": 414.58, "sid": 175, "location": 2, "content": "共同完成的过程", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 414.58, "to": 416.9, "sid": 176, "location": 2, "content": "很多教学把这两者分开来", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 416.9, "to": 418.04, "sid": 177, "location": 2, "content": "看到人还思考", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 418.04, "to": 419.22, "sid": 178, "location": 2, "content": "我是先开枪呢", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 419.22, "to": 422.24, "sid": 179, "location": 2, "content": "还是微调后开枪的枪法越来越畸形", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 422.24, "to": 424.07, "sid": 180, "location": 2, "content": "导致失苗的情况", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 424.07, "to": 426.59, "sid": 181, "location": 2, "content": "一次定位的优先级永远是最高的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 426.59, "to": 428.19, "sid": 182, "location": 2, "content": "一次定位拉过去后开枪", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 428.19, "to": 430.17, "sid": 183, "location": 2, "content": "马上确认是否击杀", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 430.17, "to": 432.65, "sid": 184, "location": 2, "content": "没击杀到马上进行二次微调", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 432.65, "to": 434.69, "sid": 185, "location": 2, "content": "整个过程是很连贯的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 434.69, "to": 436.31, "sid": 186, "location": 2, "content": "所以说这里给大家讲讲", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 436.31, "to": 438.37, "sid": 187, "location": 2, "content": "我对冷静瞄准的看法", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 438.37, "to": 442.37, "sid": 188, "location": 2, "content": "第一个冷静瞄准并不是去做所谓的脱敏训练", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 442.37, "to": 444.39, "sid": 189, "location": 2, "content": "看到人慢慢拉枪开火", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 444.39, "to": 445.27, "sid": 190, "location": 2, "content": "何为冷静", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 445.27, "to": 445.99, "sid": 191, "location": 2, "content": "在我看来", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 445.99, "to": 449.71, "sid": 192, "location": 2, "content": "第一个冷静的点在于开枪节奏的自我掌控", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 449.71, "to": 450.549, "sid": 193, "location": 2, "content": "冷静", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 450.549, "to": 452.189, "sid": 194, "location": 2, "content": "大家都说不要蹲扫", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 452.189, "to": 452.869, "sid": 195, "location": 2, "content": "不要坡扫", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 452.869, "to": 456.99, "sid": 196, "location": 2, "content": "是因为很多人的蹲和坡扫是一种应激的反应", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 456.99, "to": 459.19, "sid": 197, "location": 2, "content": "并不是自己想去这样做的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 459.19, "to": 462.43, "sid": 198, "location": 2, "content": "是因为控枪能力不足导致的不冷静的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 462.43, "to": 465.85, "sid": 199, "location": 2, "content": "他反应是因为对每把枪械的射速", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 465.85, "to": 469.53, "sid": 200, "location": 2, "content": "以及枪口上台过热情况的不了解导致的不能进", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 469.53, "to": 471.33, "sid": 201, "location": 2, "content": "我们冷静的点在于", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 471.33, "to": 472.69, "sid": 202, "location": 2, "content": "突然遇到敌人后", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 472.69, "to": 474.13, "sid": 203, "location": 2, "content": "第一枪马枪后", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 474.13, "to": 475.87, "sid": 204, "location": 2, "content": "在第二次瞄准", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 475.87, "to": 478.38, "sid": 205, "location": 2, "content": "如何确保耐心和冷静", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 478.38, "to": 481.3, "sid": 206, "location": 2, "content": "如果开枪后准心离敌人头部较近", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 481.3, "to": 483.96, "sid": 207, "location": 2, "content": "那是不是直接控枪压枪即可呢", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 483.96, "to": 484.84, "sid": 208, "location": 2, "content": "如果较远", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 484.84, "to": 487.3, "sid": 209, "location": 2, "content": "是不是移动一步再进行微调", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 487.3, "to": 488.93, "sid": 210, "location": 2, "content": "开枪更好呢", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 489.09, "to": 492.51, "sid": 211, "location": 2, "content": "如果是左轮蟒侠这样的单发枪械", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 492.51, "to": 496.27, "sid": 212, "location": 2, "content": "那我们是不是可以增加射击窗口中瞄的过程", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 496.27, "to": 498.28, "sid": 213, "location": 2, "content": "增加准的程度", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 498.28, "to": 500.96, "sid": 214, "location": 2, "content": "如果是近距离风刺太灵", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 500.96, "to": 503.42, "sid": 215, "location": 2, "content": "那我们是不是可以减少瞄的过程", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 503.42, "to": 504.7, "sid": 216, "location": 2, "content": "直接选择跑打", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 504.7, "to": 507.44, "sid": 217, "location": 2, "content": "增加我们射击窗口中射击的过程", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 507.44, "to": 510.25, "sid": 218, "location": 2, "content": "所以说我们不能掌握单一枪械", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 510.25, "to": 513.05, "sid": 219, "location": 2, "content": "得多去掌握不同枪械的射击节奏", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 513.05, "to": 516.13, "sid": 220, "location": 2, "content": "发挥不同枪械的优势", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 516.61, "to": 518.61, "sid": 221, "location": 2, "content": "很多从其他游戏转来的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 518.61, "to": 520.27, "sid": 222, "location": 2, "content": "有瞄准底子的学员", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 520.27, "to": 522.299, "sid": 223, "location": 2, "content": "本来拥有极高的瞄准水平", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 522.299, "to": 524.959, "sid": 224, "location": 2, "content": "但是因为不了解这个游戏的控枪技巧", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 524.959, "to": 526.399, "sid": 225, "location": 2, "content": "不能发挥其枪法", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 526.399, "to": 529.12, "sid": 226, "location": 2, "content": "只会蹲坡压枪段位一直上不去", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 529.12, "to": 531.24, "sid": 227, "location": 2, "content": "在练习各种控枪技巧后", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 531.24, "to": 534.77, "sid": 228, "location": 2, "content": "也成功的达到了超凡以及神话二三的水平", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 534.77, "to": 536.19, "sid": 229, "location": 2, "content": "那么第二个冷静", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 536.19, "to": 540.05, "sid": 230, "location": 2, "content": "就是对所处局势的下一步行动的冷静判断", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 540.05, "to": 542.02, "sid": 231, "location": 2, "content": "也就是心态的冷静", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 542.02, "to": 543.46, "sid": 232, "location": 2, "content": "当拉出去后", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 543.46, "to": 545.06, "sid": 233, "location": 2, "content": "已经是面临多个敌人", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 545.06, "to": 548.74, "sid": 234, "location": 2, "content": "那么这时候我们是选择开枪后摆设蹲扫一换一", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 548.74, "to": 551.29, "sid": 235, "location": 2, "content": "还是开枪后迅速撤回掩体", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 551.29, "to": 553.19, "sid": 236, "location": 2, "content": "再选择换位置拉出", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 553.19, "to": 556.8, "sid": 237, "location": 2, "content": "或者是再用道具增加下一次的对枪优势呢", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 556.8, "to": 558.22, "sid": 238, "location": 2, "content": "当击杀一人后", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 558.22, "to": 559.72, "sid": 239, "location": 2, "content": "枪口已经过热", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 559.72, "to": 562.62, "sid": 240, "location": 2, "content": "是选择扫射转移控枪击杀", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 562.62, "to": 565.42, "sid": 241, "location": 2, "content": "还是先撤回掩体或者大步移动", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 565.42, "to": 567.32, "sid": 242, "location": 2, "content": "等待枪口回正后", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 567.32, "to": 569.74, "sid": 243, "location": 2, "content": "并且躲子弹后再选择开枪", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 569.74, "to": 573.9, "sid": 244, "location": 2, "content": "击杀后在无畏契约中变强的过程", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 573.9, "to": 575.73, "sid": 245, "location": 2, "content": "就是克服本能的过程", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 575.73, "to": 577.83, "sid": 246, "location": 2, "content": "如何在一次定位的失利后", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 577.83, "to": 582.49, "sid": 247, "location": 2, "content": "仍在二次控枪微调中保证冷静和耐心", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 582.49, "to": 585.81, "sid": 248, "location": 2, "content": "本身就是一个克服本能和反直觉的训练", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 585.81, "to": 587.23, "sid": 249, "location": 2, "content": "只要残局不慌", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 587.23, "to": 588.31, "sid": 250, "location": 2, "content": "对枪不怕", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 588.31, "to": 590.3, "sid": 251, "location": 2, "content": "就已经超过了大多数人了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 590.3, "to": 594.76, "sid": 252, "location": 2, "content": "那么第三个冷静就在于对减少射击窗口中", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 594.76, "to": 596.48, "sid": 253, "location": 2, "content": "拉枪的时间", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 596.48, "to": 598.68, "sid": 254, "location": 2, "content": "也就是育苗的冷静", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 598.68, "to": 601.44, "sid": 255, "location": 2, "content": "为什么说育苗大于主动瞄准", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 601.44, "to": 602.9, "sid": 256, "location": 2, "content": "当我们预瞄做好后", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 602.9, "to": 604.64, "sid": 257, "location": 2, "content": "几乎只需要开枪", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 604.64, "to": 606.18, "sid": 258, "location": 2, "content": "甚至不需要瞄准", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 606.18, "to": 608.16, "sid": 259, "location": 2, "content": "直接蹲下坡扫都能拿下", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 608.16, "to": 610.65, "sid": 260, "location": 2, "content": "简单击杀一个冷静的准心", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 610.65, "to": 611.43, "sid": 261, "location": 2, "content": "摆放疫苗", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 611.43, "to": 613.27, "sid": 262, "location": 2, "content": "能够让我们在任何时候都能", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 613.27, "to": 614.99, "sid": 263, "location": 2, "content": "快速的做出开枪反应", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 614.99, "to": 617.37, "sid": 264, "location": 2, "content": "避免我们因为没有做好准备", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 617.37, "to": 620.23, "sid": 265, "location": 2, "content": "而出现的不冷静的蹲扫或者跑打", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 620.23, "to": 622.79, "sid": 266, "location": 2, "content": "所以说练好预瞄准心", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 622.79, "to": 625.38, "sid": 267, "location": 2, "content": "时刻在敌人可能出现的位置附近", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 625.38, "to": 629.04, "sid": 268, "location": 2, "content": "并冷静地进行敌方移动轨迹的预判", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 629.04, "to": 631.86, "sid": 269, "location": 2, "content": "还是提升实力最快的方法之一", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 631.86, "to": 633.64, "sid": 270, "location": 2, "content": "咱们在靶场练习的过程中", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 633.64, "to": 634.98, "sid": 271, "location": 2, "content": "就要以一次定位", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 634.98, "to": 638.319, "sid": 272, "location": 2, "content": "就要定准的目标思想去进行定位练习", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 638.319, "to": 640.119, "sid": 273, "location": 2, "content": "但我们在练习过程中", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 640.119, "to": 643.0, "sid": 274, "location": 2, "content": "要允许一次定位失误的存在", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 643.0, "to": 644.76, "sid": 275, "location": 2, "content": "并马上进行二次微调", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 644.76, "to": 646.94, "sid": 276, "location": 2, "content": "并完成击杀这一个击杀的练习", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 646.94, "to": 649.0, "sid": 277, "location": 2, "content": "不管是你在一次定位定准了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 649.0, "to": 650.86, "sid": 278, "location": 2, "content": "还是二次微调才定准", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 650.86, "to": 652.64, "sid": 279, "location": 2, "content": "都要以击杀该目标", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 652.64, "to": 655.76, "sid": 280, "location": 2, "content": "作为本次拉枪动作练习的结尾", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 655.76, "to": 659.16, "sid": 281, "location": 2, "content": "瞄准过程中看到人马上做出反应判断", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 659.16, "to": 662.97, "sid": 282, "location": 2, "content": "先用屏幕中心感拉近准星与目标的距离", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 662.97, "to": 666.23, "sid": 283, "location": 2, "content": "随后不要用眼睛去看确认重合", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 666.23, "to": 669.26, "sid": 284, "location": 2, "content": "而是用屏幕中心感去感受重合", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 669.26, "to": 671.42, "sid": 285, "location": 2, "content": "也就是我觉得我能够开枪了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 671.42, "to": 672.599, "sid": 286, "location": 2, "content": "这一过程", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 672.599, "to": 674.839, "sid": 287, "location": 2, "content": "这个过这个确认的过程越长", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 674.839, "to": 675.839, "sid": 288, "location": 2, "content": "也就越精准", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 675.839, "to": 677.66, "sid": 289, "location": 2, "content": "反之误差可能就会更大", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 677.66, "to": 679.98, "sid": 290, "location": 2, "content": "如果不知道什么是屏幕中心感的朋友", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 679.98, "to": 681.38, "sid": 291, "location": 2, "content": "可以去把准星关了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 681.38, "to": 682.22, "sid": 292, "location": 2, "content": "打困难靶", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 682.22, "to": 683.73, "sid": 293, "location": 2, "content": "或者朋友把感受一下", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 683.73, "to": 686.41, "sid": 294, "location": 2, "content": "其实在没有准星的支撑的情况下", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 686.41, "to": 689.41, "sid": 295, "location": 2, "content": "你的瞄准并没有想象中的那么麻", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 689.41, "to": 691.59, "sid": 296, "location": 2, "content": "我们再用屏幕中心感拉枪", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 691.59, "to": 692.8, "sid": 297, "location": 2, "content": "打出第一枪后", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 692.8, "to": 696.82, "sid": 298, "location": 2, "content": "在快速的根据弹道准星与目标的相对距离", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 696.82, "to": 699.33, "sid": 299, "location": 2, "content": "进行迅速的精准微调", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 699.33, "to": 702.43, "sid": 300, "location": 2, "content": "而我们每天练习的手眼协调与确认感", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 702.43, "to": 706.11, "sid": 301, "location": 2, "content": "就是为了增加我们在一次拉枪过程中的速度", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 706.11, "to": 710.15, "sid": 302, "location": 2, "content": "减少一次拉枪过程中准星与目标的误差", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 710.15, "to": 712.19, "sid": 303, "location": 2, "content": "练习的移动靶与跟枪", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 712.19, "to": 715.69, "sid": 304, "location": 2, "content": "就是为了在一次定位后继续阅读目标轨迹", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 715.69, "to": 718.04, "sid": 305, "location": 2, "content": "再连贯的进行微调的过程", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 718.04, "to": 719.54, "sid": 306, "location": 2, "content": "边开枪再瞄准", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 719.54, "to": 722.92, "sid": 307, "location": 2, "content": "边开枪边微调的本质是对游戏机制", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 722.92, "to": 725.56, "sid": 308, "location": 2, "content": "武器特性以及战场信息的机制", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 725.56, "to": 728.8, "sid": 309, "location": 2, "content": "利用通过快速决策与手眼协调", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 728.8, "to": 730.59, "sid": 310, "location": 2, "content": "实现高效击杀", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 730.59, "to": 733.15, "sid": 311, "location": 2, "content": "这种开枪方式并不是盲目射击", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 733.15, "to": 736.59, "sid": 312, "location": 2, "content": "而是将开火作为调整准星的起点", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 736.59, "to": 737.99, "sid": 313, "location": 2, "content": "而并非终点", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 737.99, "to": 740.19, "sid": 314, "location": 2, "content": "最终达到瞄准的平衡性", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 740.19, "to": 742.21, "sid": 315, "location": 2, "content": "获得稳定的击杀与瞄准", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 742.21, "to": 744.72, "sid": 316, "location": 2, "content": "以击杀效率为本质的瞄准", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 744.72, "to": 747.1, "sid": 317, "location": 2, "content": "那么这就是本期视频的所有内容", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 747.1, "to": 747.84, "sid": 318, "location": 2, "content": "视频教干", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 747.84, "to": 749.94, "sid": 319, "location": 2, "content": "非常感谢您能耐心听完", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 749.94, "to": 751.08, "sid": 320, "location": 2, "content": "我是只讲干货", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 751.08, "to": 752.76, "sid": 321, "location": 2, "content": "不讲噱头的电坤小子", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 752.76, "to": 754.06, "sid": 322, "location": 2, "content": "那我们下期再见", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 754.06, "to": 756.1, "sid": 323, "location": 2, "content": "拜拜failure", "music": 0.6086956080655106}, {"from": 756.1, "to": 757.26, "sid": 324, "location": 2, "content": "Not mama love you", "music": 0.9999999137931108}, {"from": 757.26, "to": 758.02, "sid": 325, "location": 2, "content": "But this ra", "music": 0.9999998387097035}], "bvid": "BV1Q6PmeREP6", "title": "FPS游戏最容易陷入的瞄准误区！先瞄“准”再开枪与“冷静”瞄准", "owner": "电坤小子嘿嘿", "duration": 759}